{"strongs": "H2790", "word": "חָרֵשׁ", "translit": "cha.rash", "root": "מחרשה", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb 1.", "gloss": "be silent, dumb, speechless", "definition": "II. [ חָרֵשׁ ] verb 1. be silent, dumb, speechless ; 2. be deaf; chiefly poet. (Late Hebrew Pi`el make deaf ; Aramaic , be dumb, deaf ; Arabic be dumb, speechless , compare Assyrian —arâšu , restrain , according to Dl Pr 100 ; see Lag BN 120 ) — Qal Imperfect יֶחֱרָ֑שׁ Ps 50:3 2 masculine singular תֶּחֱרַשׁ Ps 28:1 ; Ps 83:2 תֶּחֱרַ֑שׁ Ps 35:22 ; Ps 109:1 תֶּחֱרָ֑שׁ Ps 39:13 3 feminine plural תֶּחֱרַ֑שְׁנָה Mic 7:16 — 1. be silent , always of God's keeping silence when men pray Ps 35:22 ; Ps 50:3 ; Ps 83:2 ; Ps 109:1 followed by אֶלֿ Ps 39:13 . 2. be deaf , subject ׳ י , followed by מִמֶּנִּי Ps 28:1 subject אָזְנַיִם Mic 7:16 . Hiph`il Perfect חֶחֱרִשׁ Num 30:15 ; Gen 34:5 יְחֶחֱרִישׁ consecutive Num 30:5 ; Num 30:8 וְהֶחֱרִשׁ consecutive Num 30:12 הֶחֱרַ֫שְׁתִּי Esth 7:4 + 2 t. etc.; Imperfect יַחֲרִישׁ Num 30:15 + 2 t. (including Zeph 3:17 see below); 2 masculine singular תַּחֲרִישׁ Hab 1:13 jussive תַּחְרֵשׁ 1Sam 7:8 2 masculine plural תַּחֲרִישׁוּן Job 13:5 תַּחֲרִשׁוּן Exod 14:14 , etc.; Imperative הַחֲרֵשׁ Judg 18:19 + 2 t.; הַחֲרִ֫ישִׁי 2Sam 13:20 הַחֲרִ֫ישׁוּ Job 13:13 ; Isa 41:1 Infinitive absolute הַחֲרֵשׁ Num 30:15 + 2 t.; Participle מַחֲרִישׁ Gen 24:21 + 2 t. (including 1Sam 10:27 see below); מַחֲרִישִׁים 2Sam 19:11 — 1. be silent (= exhibit silence ) \\ \\ a. almost always of men Gen 24:21 ; Gen 34:5 ; Exod 14:14 (all J ), Judg 18:19 ; 2Sam 13:20 ; 2Sam 19:11 ; 2Kgs 18:36 = Isa 36:21 ; Jer 4:19 ; Job 6:24 ; Job 13:5 (twice in verse); Job 13:19 ; Job 33:31 ; Job 33:33 ; Prov 11:12 ; Prov 17:28 ; Ps 32:3 ; Neh 5:8 ; Esth 4:14 (twice in verse); Esth 7:4 also וַיְהִי כְּמַחֲרִישׁ 1Sam 10:27 (but read rather ויהי כְּמֵחֹדֶשׁ and it came to pass after about a month , ᵐ5 Dr ); יחרישׁ באהבתו Zeph 3:17 ( ᵐ5 ᵑ6 יְחַדֵּשׁ he will renew his love, see especially Buhl ZAW see 1885, 183); ׳ ח with לְ person keep silence at one, i.e. fail to make objection at proper time Num 30:5 ; Num 30:8 ; Num 30:12 ; Num 30:15 (3 t. in verse) (all P ); אלי ׳ הח Isa 41:1 pregnantly = come silently unto me ; followed by מִן person cease to speak with Jer 38:27 be silent about, pass by in silence , followed by accusative בַּדָּיו ׳ אח Job 41:4 . \\ \\ b. rarely of God, permitting evil in silence Hab 1:13 ; Isa 42:14 ; Ps 50:21 . 2. once causat. make silent , with accusative Job 11:3 . 3. be deaf, shew deafness: אַלֿ תַּחֲרֵשׁ מִמֶּנּוּ מִזְּעֹק 1Sam 7:8 be not deaf (turning) from us, so as not to cry . ** Hithpa`el Imperfect 3 masculine plural וַיִּתְחָֽרְשׁוּ Judg 16:2 and they kept quiet .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3186')\">BDB3186</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2790')\">H2790</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3185')\">BDB3185</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3187')\">BDB3187</entry></div><p> II. [<bdbheb>חָרֵשׁ</bdbheb>] <div class=\"point\"><b>verb 1.</b> <highlightword>be silent, dumb, speechless</highlightword>; </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> be deaf; chiefly poet. (Late Hebrew Pi`el <highlight>make deaf</highlight>; Aramaic <placeholder2013/>, <placeholder2014/> <highlight>be dumb, deaf</highlight>; Arabic <placeholder2015/> <highlight>be dumb, speechless</highlight>, compare Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>—arâšu</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>restrain</highlight>, according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>Pr 100</sup></lookup>; see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 120</sup></lookup>) — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יֶחֱרָ֑שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 50:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,3)\">Ps 50:3</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>תֶּחֱרַשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 28:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,28,1)\">Ps 28:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 83:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"83\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"83\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,83,2)\">Ps 83:2</ref> <bdbheb>תֶּחֱרַ֑שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 35:22\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,22)\">Ps 35:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 109:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"109\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"109\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,109,1)\">Ps 109:1</ref> <bdbheb>תֶּחֱרָ֑שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 39:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,39,13)\">Ps 39:13</ref> 3 feminine plural <bdbheb>תֶּחֱרַ֑שְׁנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 7:16\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,16)\">Mic 7:16</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>be silent</highlight>, always of God's keeping silence when men pray <ref ref=\"Ps 35:22\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,22)\">Ps 35:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 50:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,3)\">Ps 50:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 83:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"83\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"83\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,83,2)\">Ps 83:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 109:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"109\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"109\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,109,1)\">Ps 109:1</ref> followed by <bdbheb>אֶלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 39:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,39,13)\">Ps 39:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>be deaf</highlight>, subject <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, followed by <bdbheb>מִמֶּנִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 28:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,28,1)\">Ps 28:1</ref> subject <bdbheb>אָזְנַיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 7:16\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,16)\">Mic 7:16</ref>. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>חֶחֱרִשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 30:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,15)\">Num 30:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 34:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,34,5)\">Gen 34:5</ref> <bdbheb>יְחֶחֱרִישׁ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Num 30:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,5)\">Num 30:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,8)\">Num 30:8</ref> <bdbheb>וְהֶחֱרִשׁ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Num 30:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,12)\">Num 30:12</ref> <bdbheb>הֶחֱרַ֫שְׁתִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 7:4\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(17,7,4)\">Esth 7:4</ref> + 2 t. etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יַחֲרִישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 30:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,15)\">Num 30:15</ref> + 2 t. (including <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:17\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,17)\">Zeph 3:17</ref> see below); 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>תַּחֲרִישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hab 1:13\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(35,1,13)\">Hab 1:13</ref> jussive <bdbheb>תַּחְרֵשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 7:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,8)\">1Sam 7:8</ref> 2 masculine plural <bdbheb>תַּחֲרִישׁוּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 13:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,5)\">Job 13:5</ref> <bdbheb>תַּחֲרִשׁוּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 14:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,14)\">Exod 14:14</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>הַחֲרֵשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 18:19\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,19)\">Judg 18:19</ref> + 2 t.; <bdbheb>הַחֲרִ֫ישִׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:20\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,20)\">2Sam 13:20</ref> <bdbheb>הַחֲרִ֫ישׁוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 13:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,13)\">Job 13:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 41:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,1)\">Isa 41:1</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>הַחֲרֵשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 30:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,15)\">Num 30:15</ref> + 2 t.; <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַחֲרִישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 24:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,21)\">Gen 24:21</ref> + 2 t. (including <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:27\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,27)\">1Sam 10:27</ref> see below); <bdbheb>מַחֲרִישִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,11)\">2Sam 19:11</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>be silent</highlight> (= <highlight>exhibit silence</highlight>) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> almost always of men <ref ref=\"Gen 24:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,21)\">Gen 24:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 34:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,34,5)\">Gen 34:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 14:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,14)\">Exod 14:14</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 18:19\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,19)\">Judg 18:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:20\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,20)\">2Sam 13:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,11)\">2Sam 19:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:36\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,36)\">2Kgs 18:36</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 36:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,36,21)\">Isa 36:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 4:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,19)\">Jer 4:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 6:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,24)\">Job 6:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 13:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,5)\">Job 13:5</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Job 13:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,19)\">Job 13:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 33:31\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,31)\">Job 33:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 33:33\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,33)\">Job 33:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 11:12\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,12)\">Prov 11:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 17:28\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,28)\">Prov 17:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 32:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,32,3)\">Ps 32:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 5:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,5,8)\">Neh 5:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 4:14\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(17,4,14)\">Esth 4:14</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Esth 7:4\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(17,7,4)\">Esth 7:4</ref> also <bdbheb>וַיְהִי כְּמַחֲרִישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:27\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,27)\">1Sam 10:27</ref> (but read rather <bdbheb>ויהי כְּמֵחֹדֶשׁ</bdbheb> <highlight>and it came to pass after about a month</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>); <bdbheb>יחרישׁ באהבתו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:17\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,17)\">Zeph 3:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>יְחַדֵּשׁ</bdbheb> he <highlight>will renew</highlight> his love, see especially <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>ZAW</sup></lookup> see 1885, 183); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> with <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> person <highlight>keep silence at</highlight> one, i.e. fail to make objection at proper time <ref ref=\"Num 30:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,5)\">Num 30:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,8)\">Num 30:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,12)\">Num 30:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,15)\">Num 30:15</ref> (3 t. in verse) (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>אלי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,1)\">Isa 41:1</ref> pregnantly = <highlight>come silently unto me</highlight>; followed by <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> person <highlight>cease to speak with</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 38:27\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,27)\">Jer 38:27</ref> <highlight>be silent about, pass by in silence</highlight>, followed by accusative <bdbheb>בַּדָּיו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 41:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,41,4)\">Job 41:4</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> rarely of God, permitting evil in silence <ref ref=\"Hab 1:13\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(35,1,13)\">Hab 1:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 42:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,14)\">Isa 42:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 50:21\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,21)\">Ps 50:21</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> once causat. <highlight>make silent</highlight>, with accusative <ref ref=\"Job 11:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,11,3)\">Job 11:3</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>be deaf, shew deafness:</highlight> <bdbheb>אַלֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>תַּחֲרֵשׁ מִמֶּנּוּ מִזְּעֹק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 7:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,8)\">1Sam 7:8</ref> <highlight>be not deaf</highlight> (turning) <highlight>from us, so as not to cry</highlight>. </div><div class=\"remarks\"><b>**</b><b>Hithpa`el</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>וַיִּתְחָֽרְשׁוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 16:2\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,2)\">Judg 16:2</ref> <highlight>and they kept quiet</highlight>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ps 50:3", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 50, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ps 28:1", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 28, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Ps 83:2", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 83, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ps 35:22", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 35, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Ps 109:1", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 109, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Ps 39:13", "